WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:06.039
We have achieved our longed-for freedom.

00:00:06.039 --> 00:00:08.800
The political victory over communism is, however,

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.920
merely the first stage of our struggle.

00:00:19.039 --> 00:00:20.959
The historic turnaround

00:00:20.959 --> 00:00:24.079
that has taken place in Poland

00:00:24.079 --> 00:00:30.079
was caused by a pursuit of the Europe 

00:00:30.079 --> 00:00:34.560
from we which were cut off,

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:38.560
with the outbreak of World War Two.

00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:40.439
Our actions

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:43.159
are playing an important role

00:00:43.159 --> 00:00:48.159
in further transforming Eastern Europe.

00:00:48.159 --> 00:00:50.200
Our success

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.560
will be shared with all the nations of Europe.

00:00:54.920 --> 00:01:00.159
It would be a real misfortune if Europe

00:01:00.159 --> 00:01:04.800
were to be divided between

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:08.239
the rich West and the poor East.

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:15.479
Let me remind you that it was the Solidarity trade union

00:01:15.479 --> 00:01:17.400
that launched the process sometimes called

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.680
the second Spring of the People.

00:01:22.039 --> 00:01:24.959
We continue our efforts

00:01:24.959 --> 00:01:27.720
despite considerable sacrifices.

00:01:29.439 --> 00:01:32.400
The time has come for

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:36.879
Europe-wide solidarity in full measure.

00:01:36.879 --> 00:01:37.800
&nbsp;

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.560
The goal

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:44.319
is the real integration of Poland with Europe:

00:01:44.319 --> 00:01:52.079
as a continent of freedom, democracy and prosperity.

